{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52997","headline":"题戴徵君幽居 · 王绶","name":"题戴徵君幽居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高卧云烟外，幽居静者心。\n门庭新种竹，桃李旧成林。\n窗户泉声入，池塘柳色深。\n松花多醴酒，终日会知音。\n（日本藏唐抄本《新撰类林抄》卷四）（按：《李端诗集》卷中有《送戴徵士还山》，戴徵士、戴徵君当爲同一人，因知王绶与李端同时。\n《新撰类林抄》收诗以开元、大历间作者爲主。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52997.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52997","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}